WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.877
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ko Rental business ke liye step by step use karenge.

00:00:05.877 --> 00:00:08.580
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:22.091
Tent, sound system, furniture ya camera kiraye par dene wale business mein sabse zaroori cheez hai ki ek hi saaman do logon ko ek hi tareekh par na chala jaye, aur deposit aur wapsi ka hisaab saaf ho.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:29.254
Ye Rentals screen hai. Har rental ki ek line: kaun customer, kaunse tareekh, kitna amount, aur uski halat.

00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:37.491
Booked matlab abhi diya nahi, Out matlab saaman customer ke paas hai, aur Overdue laal, matlab wapas aane ki tareekh nikal gayi.

00:00:37.491 --> 00:00:43.925
Kyun? Kyunki kiraye ke business mein sabse bada nuksan late wapsi aur bhoole hue saaman se hota hai.

00:00:44.316 --> 00:00:50.534
Naya rental. Rentals mein customer zaroori hai, kyunki deposit aur wapsi ke liye pata hona chahiye kaun hai.

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:52.607
Deshmukh Enterprises ko chunte hain.

00:00:52.993 --> 00:00:57.284
Ab kiraye ki tareekh aur samay, start aur end. Aur kaunsa saaman.

00:00:57.284 --> 00:01:00.783
Rentable products mein Tent bees by bees chunte hain.

00:01:00.783 --> 00:01:07.649
Saaman ke saath uske rate dikhte hain: daily, weekly, aur ek din ka kiraya teen hazaar paanch sau. Kyun?

00:01:07.649 --> 00:01:13.524
Kyunki alag alag period ke alag rate hote hain, aur app apne aap sahi kiraya nikalta hai.

00:01:13.891 --> 00:01:20.504
Yahan deposit bhi dikhta hai: ye wapas hone wala security paisa hai, jaise aath hazaar paanch sau.

00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:26.644
Neeche amount paid now mein jo paisa abhi liya wo likhte hain aur method chunte hain. Kyun?

00:01:26.644 --> 00:01:33.662
Kyunki kiraye par dene wale ko saaman ki kimat ke barabar bharosa chahiye, aur deposit wahi bharosa hai.

00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:37.498
Ab date clash. Hamare paas ye tent sirf aath hain.

00:01:37.498 --> 00:01:41.720
Agar customer barah tent maange, to app booking rok deta hai.

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:45.873
Dekhiye, quantity barah likhte hain aur Confirm dabate hain.

00:01:45.873 --> 00:01:50.510
App ne saaf bata diya ki itne tent us tareekh par khali nahi. Kyun?

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:57.569
Isse double booking kabhi nahi hoti, aur ek hi shaadi par do jagah tent bhejne ki sharam se bachte ho.

00:01:57.936 --> 00:02:03.269
Quantity do kar dete hain, jo khali hai. Confirm booking dabate hi rental ban gaya.

00:02:03.269 --> 00:02:08.667
Ab ye tent us tareekh ke liye reserve hai, aur koi doosri booking ise le nahi sakti.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:29.302
Availability calendar. Upar saaman chuno, neeche mahine ka calendar.

00:02:29.302 --> 00:02:34.804
Hara matlab khali, peela matlab kuch booked, laal matlab poora booked. Kyun?

00:02:34.804 --> 00:02:41.391
Naya booking lene se pehle ek nazar mein dekh sakte ho ki kaunsi tareekh par saaman milega.

00:02:42.982 --> 00:02:48.041
Jab customer saaman lene aata hai to booked rental par Mark picked up dabao.

00:02:48.041 --> 00:02:52.833
Ab uski halat Out ho jati hai, aur wapsi ki tareekh par nazar rehti hai.

00:02:59.713 --> 00:03:06.728
Ab wapsi. Jo rental Out hai use kholte hain. Har item ki halat chuno: Good, Damaged ya Missing.

00:03:06.728 --> 00:03:12.488
Toot phoot ho to damage charge, aur der se aaya to late fee yahan likhte hain.

00:03:12.488 --> 00:03:18.986
Mark as returned dabate hi rental band, aur deposit se kaat kar baaki hisaab saaf. Kyun?

00:03:18.986 --> 00:03:24.524
Kyunki wapsi par jhagda sabse zyada hota hai, aur yahan sab likha hota hai.

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:30.302
Rental History. Jo rental wapas aa gaye ya cancel ho gaye wo yahan jama hote hain.

00:03:30.302 --> 00:03:36.297
Kisi bhi purane rental ko kholkar dekh sakte ho ki kisne kab liya aur kya hisaab hua. Kyun?

00:03:36.297 --> 00:03:40.711
Kyunki purani bahes ya repeat customer ki jaankari yahin milti hai.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:48.661
Aur Products. Har rentable item ke saath uska daily, weekly aur monthly rate, aur deposit likha hota hai.

00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:56.307
Tent kholte hain. Jo items kiraye ke saath bikte bhi hain, jaise balloons, wo alag rakhe jaate hain. Kyun?

00:03:56.307 --> 00:04:00.058
Ek hi dukaan mein kiraya aur bikri dono chalte hain.

00:04:03.868 --> 00:04:06.062
Aur aam bikri bhi wahi rehti hai.

00:04:06.062 --> 00:04:13.377
Sell screen par balloons ya ribbon jaisa saaman normal bill se bech sakte ho, aur wo rental se alag rehta hai.

00:04:13.377 --> 00:04:15.439
Ek hi app, ek hi customer list.

00:04:17.349 --> 00:04:29.887
Aaj humne Rental ka flow dekha: booking, deposit, date clash ki rok, availability calendar, saaman uthana, wapsi ki halat aur late fee, history, aur rate ka setup.

00:04:29.887 --> 00:04:35.194
Ek practical baat: har rental mein customer aur deposit zaroor likho.

00:04:35.194 --> 00:04:39.040
Wapsi par yahi do cheezein jhagde se bachati hain.
